Subject: [PATCH] feat(export): add Markdown table export format

Add a 'markdown' ExportFormat that serializes result sets as GitHub-flavored
Markdown tables (pipes escaped as \|, newlines flattened to spaces, NULL as
empty cells), with .md / text/markdown download helpers, a Markdown entry in
the shared export menu, tests, and docs.

Closes #273
