+## Markdown Format
+
+### Structure
+
+```text
+| id | name | email |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| 1 | John Doe | john@example.com |
+| 2 | Jane Smith | jane@example.com |
+```
+
+### Features
+
+- Header row from column names, followed by a `---` separator row
+- Pipes (`|`) escaped as `\|` so they don't split cells
+- Newlines inside values replaced with spaces so each row stays on one line
+- NULL values as empty cells
+- Objects and arrays rendered as JSON
+
 ## Tips
 
 - **Large exports**: Export happens in memory, so very large results may be slow
